    out property <string> maximize: "M8 3H5a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v3 M21 8V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-3 M3 16v3a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h3 M16 21h3a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-3";
